Subject: [PATCH 14/14] USCL: follow shell palette in boot and shader loading
 UI

Scope styling to opted-in shell games. Preserve real progress values, compiler work, guest rendering, input, cancellation and dialog lifetimes. Standalone launches and invalid palettes retain upstream styling.
